<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

<title>Word Counter Tool - Free Online Word, Character & Sentence Counter</title>

<meta name="description" content="Free online word counter tool to instantly count words, characters, sentences, and paragraphs. Fast SEO-friendly text analysis for writers, students, bloggers, and developers." />

